  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} begins to tear apart the hair-thin cerebral mesh inside the cerebrex core. The mesh twists and groans, as if alive. Electricity arcs among the latticework frame - then in an instant, all goes dark and lifeless.\n\nThe mechanoid whirring stops. Here, and all across the planet, mechanoids begin to permanently deactivate, no longer under the control of the mechhive.\n\nThe mechanoid threat is over. But your story continues... -->
  <OdysseyDestroyedCredits>{PAWN_nameDef} comença a trencar la xarxa cerebral fina com un cabell dins del nucli del cèrebrex. La malla es retorça i gemega, com si estigués viva. L’electricitat salta per dins del marc neuronal; després, en un instant, tot es torna fosc i queda inert.\n\nEl brunzit mecanoide s’atura. Aquí, i arreu del planeta, els mecanoides es van desactivant, ja no estan sota el control del mecaeixam.\n\nL’amenaça mecanoide ha acabat. Però la vostra història continua...</OdysseyDestroyedCredits>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} begins working to free a processing node buried within the core. The latticework frame convulses as if in agony. As {PAWN_nameDef} pulls the node free, the mesh begins to mend, repairing the damage. The core rebuilds its defences and closes.\n\nTurning the node over, {PAWN_nameDef} recoils as it sparks to life, pulsing in time with the core. In {PAWN_possessive} hand, {PAWN_nameDef} holds a weapon of untold power.\n\nThe story continues... -->
  <OdysseyScavengedCredits>{PAWN_nameDef} comença a desenterrar un node de processament dins del nucli. Les trames neuronals convulsionen com si agonitzessin. A mesura que {PAWN_nameDef} allibera el node, la xarxa comença es doblega i repara els danys. El nucli reconstrueix les seves defenses i es tanca.\n\nGirant el node, {PAWN_nameDef} retrocedeix mentre cobra vida a les seves mans, bategant al mateix ritme que el nucli. {PAWN_nameDef} té a les mans una arma d’un poder incalculable.\n\nLa història continua...</OdysseyScavengedCredits>

